# Nine-slice frame, 4px border. Cool and desaturated on purpose — it borrows
# the board's colours, not the gems', so nothing in the UI can be mistaken for
# a piece.
name puzzle-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key L deep-3-tile
key m deep-2
key d deep-1
key b deep-0-bg
pixels
oooooooooooooooo
oLLLLLLLLLLLLLLo
oLmmmmmmmmmmmmLo
oLmddddddddddmLo
*8 oLmdbbbbbbbbdmLo
oLmddddddddddmLo
oLmmmmmmmmmmmmLo
ommmmmmmmmmmmmmo
oooooooooooooooo
